      "Q": {
        "slot": "Q",
        "id": "ViegoQ",
        "name": "Blade of the Ruined King",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Viego's spectral blade passively deals bonus percent current Health damage <OnHit>On-Hit</OnHit> and strikes twice vs. enemies he recently hit with an Ability, stealing Health.<br><br>Viego can activate this Ability to thrust his zweihander forward, impaling enemies in front of him.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Viego's Attacks deal an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">2/3/4/5/6% current Health physical damage</span>. His first Attack against an enemy he has recently damaged with an Ability hits a second time, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">((20% Attack Damage) + (15% Ability Power)) physical damage</span> and restoring <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">150% of damage dealt as Health</span>. These bonuses are kept during <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Possession</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active: </span>Viego stabs forward, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(25/40/55/70/85 + (70% Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The second strike can Critically Strike and applies <span>On-Hit</span> effects while not <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Possessing</span> an enemy. Its healing is decreased to 125% vs. jungle monsters and 100% vs. minions. <br />The bonus <span>On-Hit</span> damage can critically strike for <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(0.6/0.9/1.2/1.5/1.8% + (1.4/2.1/2.8/3.5/4.2% Critical Strike Damage)) current Health</span> and deals a minimum of <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">10/15/20/25/30 damage</span>. It deals a max of <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">80 damage</span> vs. jungle monsters.<br />This Ability's cast time is reduced with Attack Speed. Its damage scales with Critical Strike Chance and Damage at 60% effectiveness.</span>",
        "iconFile": "ViegoQ.png",
