        "id": "ViegoW",
        "name": "Spectral Maw",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Viego charges up before dashing forward, releasing a ball of concentrated Black Mist that stuns the first enemy hit.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span>Begin Charging:</span> Viego begins gathering Mist, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> himself by 10%.<br /><br /><span>Release:</span> Viego dashes forward and hurls the gathered Mist. Deals <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(80/135/190/245/300 + (100% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stuns</span> the first enemy hit for 0.25 to 1.25 seconds based on charge time.<br /><br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability's Cooldown is set to 3 seconds when interrupted.</span>",
