      "E": {
        "slot": "E",
        "id": "ViegoE",
        "name": "Harrowed Path",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Viego commands the Black Mist to haunt and surround a piece of terrain. Viego can hide in the Mist as a wraith, gaining camouflage, Move Speed, and Attack Speed.",
        "bodyHtml": "Viego sends forth a spectre to haunt the first terrain hit, surrounding it with Mist for 8 seconds. Viego gains <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Camouflage</span>, <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">(25/27.5/30/32.5/35% + (0.04% Ability Power)) Move Speed</span>, and <span>30/35/40/45/50% Attack Speed</span> while inside the Mist.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\"><span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Camouflaged</span> units cannot be seen unless an enemy champion is inside their detection radius.<br />Viego reveals himself for 0.6 seconds whenever he attacks or uses an Ability.</span>",
