        "name": "Heartbreaker",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Viego teleports to a nearby location and executes an enemy champion on arrival, piercing their heart and causing a destructive shockwave around them that knocks away their allies.",
        "bodyHtml": "Viego discards any souls he is currently <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Possessing</span> and teleports. On arrival he Attacks the champion with the lowest percent Health, briefly <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> them by 99% and dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(120% Attack Damage) + (12/16/20 + (5% bonus Attack Damage))missing Health physical damage</span>. Other nearby enemies are <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knocked Back</span> and take <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(120% Attack Damage) physical damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">This Ability applies on-hit effects to the primary target and spell effects to everything else.<br />Damage scales with Critical Strike Chance and Damage at 70% effectiveness.</span>",
